  "title": "CCS HCS SB 656 (98th GA, 2nd Reg. Sess.), An Act ... relating to weapons, with penalty provisions, an emergency clause for a certain section, and an effective date for a certain section",
  "urls": [
    "https://house.mo.gov/BillContent.aspx?bill=SB656&year=2016&code=R&style=new",
